Notice for the NIST material in this directory:
  nist-sha3.txt is converted (by gen_vectors.py, 2026-10-26; changes: the Msg / MD / Output fields
  re-written as one driver record per vector, Msg truncated to Len bits = the CAVP convention for
  Len 0) from SHA3_256/SHA3_512 ShortMsg and LongMsg and SHAKE128/SHAKE256 ShortMsg, LongMsg and
  VariableOut .rsp files of
  https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Cryptographic-Algorithm-Validation-Program/documents/sha3/sha-3bytetestvectors.zip
  (zip sha256 cd07701af2e47f5cc889d642528b4bf11f8b6eb55797c7307a96828ed8d8fc8c) and .../shakebytetestvectors.zip
  (zip sha256 debfebc3157b3ceea002b84ca38476420389a3bf7e97dc5f53ea4689a16de4c7), fetched 2026-10-26;
  per-file sha256 in the header of nist-sha3.txt.
  acvp.txt is converted (same date, same kind of change; ML-KEM-768 groups only, hex lowercased) from
  https://github.com/usnistgov/ACVP-Server commit 975de31eb83d87039ec88934fdc47d8c312b892d,
  gen-val/json-files/ML-KEM-keyGen-FIPS203/internalProjection.json and
  gen-val/json-files/ML-KEM-encapDecap-FIPS203/internalProjection.json (sha256 in its header).
Source: National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).

